{'symbol': 'BK', 'date': '2022-01-03 09:00:00', 'title': 'BNY MELLON ANNOUNCES REDEMPTION OF 2.600% SENIOR NOTES DUE 2022', 'text': 'NEW YORK, JAN.\xa03, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BANK OF NEW YORK MELLON CORPORATION ("BNY MELLON") TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL REDEEM ALL OF THE ISSUED AND OUTSTANDING 2.600% SENIOR NOTES DUE FEBRUARY 7, 2022 (CUSIP 06406RAA5) (THE "NOTES"). THE NOTES HAVE AN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF $1,250,000,000.'}